Builds Helium's DNS uncloaking patch without the bundled uBlock Origin.

ublock-dns-uncloaking.patch gives the bundled uBlock component extra webRequest
privileges through Manifest::IsUBlockComponent(), which comes from the uBlock
component patches Rooster skips. With no bundled uBlock there is nothing to
match, so the check is always false. The DNS canonical-name API itself stays.

--- a/extensions/renderer/api/web_request_natives.cc
+++ b/extensions/renderer/api/web_request_natives.cc
@@ -31,9 +31,7 @@
 namespace {
 
 bool IsBundledUBlock(const Extension* extension) {
-  return extension &&
-         extension->location() == mojom::ManifestLocation::kComponent &&
-         Manifest::IsUBlockComponent(extension->id());
+  return false;
 }
 
 // Parses a webRequest.RequestFilter into a WebRequestParsedFilter, or returns
